&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-life-balance:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and personal collaboration in the office are central to us, but we also offer a regular remote work day for added flexibility. In addition, you can compensate for overtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on:&lt;/strong&gt; You receive 26 days of paid leave plus an additional 4 compensation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&lt;/strong&gt; Health benefits and dedicated Mental Health Awareness Days put your health and well-being front and center.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow through our diverse training programs and leverage internal career initiatives for your personal development across the WPP network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job:&lt;/strong&gt; Look forward to unforgettable team events, exclusive employee discounts, and many more highlights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself:&lt;/strong&gt; Everyone is warmly welcome here – diversity and equal opportunities are at the core of who we are.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is what you move:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Manager Media Solutions | Engagement (m/f/d),&lt;/strong&gt; you are the key contact for our agencies on programmatic and Media Solutions topics. You collaborate closely with internal teams, drive product adoption, and support agencies in identifying new business opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Acting as the main programmatic contact for assigned agencies, providing guidance, building strong relationships, and supporting their daily programmatic activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Team Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Working closely with your fellow Engagement Manager, Product Management, and Campaign teams to ensure seamless coordination, shared responsibilities, and reliable agency support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Development &amp;amp; Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborating with Product Management to develop and enhance Media Solutions products, understanding their functionalities, and introducing new solutions to agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Knowledge Sharing:&lt;/strong&gt; Preparing and delivering engaging onboarding sessions, product trainings, and workshops to strengthen agency expertise and drive product adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business &amp;amp; Strategic Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Supporting agencies in new business opportunities and pitches, conducting competitor and benchmark analyses, and identifying opportunities for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Communication &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Keeping relevant stakeholders informed about product developments, progress, and roadmaps while preparing clear, insightful reports and presentations when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following qualities distinguish you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Media Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 3–4 years of professional experience in digital media, ideally with exposure to programmatic advertising, media technology, or agency collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media &amp;amp; Programmatic Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of the digital media landscape, marketing concepts, and programmatic advertising, combined with a genuine interest in emerging media technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presentation &amp;amp; Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong ability to explain complex topics clearly, deliver engaging presentations and workshops, and communicate confidently with different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; A structured, solution-oriented mindset with the ability to analyze information, identify opportunities, and develop practical recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational &amp;amp; Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Confident use of Microsoft Excel, PowerPoint, and Outlook, with strong attention to detail and the ability to maintain quality in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Collaboration Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English and German, combined with a collaborative, proactive approach and enthusiasm for working with agencies and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore you are: &lt;strong&gt;#media-tech-enthusiast #solution-finder #team-player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this job sounds exciting to you, we strongly encourage you to apply, even if you don&#39;t have every qualification listed above.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
